  "headline": "Government Opens 154,052 CPNS 2026 Positions and Sets SKD Thresholds",
  "seoTitle": "CPNS 2026 Registration and SKD Threshold Details",
  "metaDescription": "The government has opened 154,052 CPNS 2026 positions and officially established the passing grades for the Basic Competency Selection (SKD) exam.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The 2026 CPNS civil servant recruitment process has officially opened with 154,052 available positions.",
    "Candidates can register and view vacancy details through the official SSCASN portal until December 21, 2026.",
    "The government has announced the official passing grade requirements for the Basic Competency Selection (SKD) examinations."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government has initiated the 2026 civil servant recruitment process, offering 154,052 positions across various departments and agencies, including 2,007 roles within the BPKP to support national priorities under the administration of President Prabowo. Interested applicants are required to register through the official national portal, SSCASN, with the application period scheduled to conclude on December 21, 2026. Alongside the launch, officials have formally released the passing grade requirements for the Basic Competency Selection (SKD) phase of the hiring process. Discussions regarding the future of the recruitment process are ongoing, with some members of the House of Representatives (DPR) Commission II proposing changes to the qualification criteria, specifically regarding the inclusion of high school graduates in future cycles. Detailed guidelines for the current selection process, including document verification and e-meterai requirements, are accessible via official government channels.",
